### Login as Alex
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "Alex.Nguyen@Example.org " }

### Unknown email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nobody@example.org" }

### Blank email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "" }

### Unknown route
GET {{baseUrl}}/nope

### List grants (all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/grants
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### List open grants
GET {{baseUrl}}/grants?status=Open
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Grant detail (GR-100001)
GET {{baseUrl}}/grants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Add task to GR-100004
POST {{baseUrl}}/grants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000104/tasks
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Call applicant", "dueDate": "2026-03-10", "priority": "Low" }

### Close GR-100001 (refused while a High task is pending, BR-5)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/grants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101/close
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Complete task "Verify bank details"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201/complete
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Overdue tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/overdue
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Edit task "Verify bank details" (If-Match is the task's version)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000201
X-User-Id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
If-Match: "1"
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Verify bank details", "dueDate": "2026-03-07", "priority": "High" }
